<title>UK: Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on Telecom Italia.</title>
<headline>Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on Telecom Italia.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Gurnsey) has issued 15 million American-style call warrants, on Telecom Italia, lead manager Credit Lyonnais said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    4250 ITL		  PREMIUM	13.76 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     385 ITL		   GEARING	10.71 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 22.JAN.97-08.OCT.97   PAYDATE	22.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG		MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  4070 ITL</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
